{"id":952,"title":{"romaji":"Gochuumon wa Usagi desu ka??: Dear My Sister","english":"Is the Order a Rabbit?? ～Dear My Sister～","native":"ご注文はうさぎですか?? ~Dear My Sister~"},"slug":"gochuumon_wa_usagi_desu_ka_dear_my_sister","synopsis":"Cocoa visits her family, in the mountains, after quite some time again after her sister Mocha wrote her, through a letter, to come back soon. Her friends will have to spend a week in the town without her, while Cocoa has time with her family that she hasn't seen for a long time. But Chino, Cocoa's self proclaimed little sister, wants to go watch, with Cocoa and all her friends, the fireworks in the fireworks festival, which is coming up in less than a week. Cocoa decides to return early as she misses them all, but will she arrive in time for the climax of the festival?\n\n(Source: TMDB)","format":"MOVIE","season":"FALL","year":2017,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:49","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 02:30:37","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":33280},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":21813},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":12138},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":12118},{"site":"ANN","externalId":18757},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":8240},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":1895,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/0gKSwRFp4g6scp1vFPbGMpIjADuiCQxkaDZZivJw.jpg"},{"id":1896,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/gau31nrsZt9GhPeLl3s9Mq8h4rBnZDmD9EQXIeTg.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":199,"name":"production doA","slug":"production_doa"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":60,"name":"Gochuumon wa Usagi Desu ka?","slug":"gochiusa"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":7300,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":7301,"title":{"romaji":"Happiness Encore","native":null},"performances":[{"alias":null,"as":null,"memberAlias":null,"memberAs":null,"relevance":1,"artist":{"id":93,"slug":"inori_minase","name":{"main":"Inori Minase","native":"水瀬いのり"}},"member":null},{"alias":n